        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-09T00:51:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>N</strong><strong>ame:&nbsp;</strong>Syncopated Synergy</p><p><strong>Members:&nbsp;</strong>Anthony Drake, the Ardent Adept (Lead Singer, Tenor)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>Dr. Meredith Stinson, aka Tachyon (Soprano)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>Portja Kir-Pro, aka Sky Scraper (Contralto)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>Harry Robert \"Slim\" Walker, aka Mr. Fixer (Bass)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lilith Corvus, the Matriarch (Soprano)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>Ivan Grigori Ramonat, the&nbsp;</span><span>Baron Blade (Baritone)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>Gene-bound Banshee (Countertenor)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; S'sdari the Bloody (Mezzo-soprano)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Jansa Vi Dero, the Terminarch (Contralto)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pterodactyl Thief (Backing Vocals)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>Michael Conteh, the Naturalist (Pterodactyl Wrangler)</span></p><p><strong>Music Style:&nbsp;</strong>A cappella</p><p><strong>Hit Song:&nbsp;</strong>The Price of Victory</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Incidentally, I tried to include every target that deals sonic damage. &nbsp;I excluded targets that deal any type of damage (Visionary, Tempest, Chrono-Ranger, and Omnitron-X (Mr. Fixer was included because I wanted to get every voice, and I was short a male singer), and Sonic Mine, but I think I got every other sonic user.</p>",
